{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudstokenssemantic\/multiplefontcompositesemantictoken"]}],"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MultipleFontCompositeSemanticToken","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"c:@M@OUDSTokensSemantic@objc(cs)MultipleFontCompositeSemanticToken","modules":[{"name":"Tokens for semantics"}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MultipleFontCompositeSemanticToken","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"class","title":"MultipleFontCompositeSemanticToken","roleHeading":"Class"},"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Inherits From","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/objc(cs)NSObject"],"type":"inheritsFrom","kind":"relationships"},{"title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/objc(pl)NSObject","doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/s7CVarArgP","doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/SL","doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/s28CustomDebugStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/s23CustomStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/SQ","doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/SH","doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/documentation\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/MultipleFontCompositeSemanticToken"},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Kind of semantic tokens which will wrap a combination of "},{"code":"FontCompositeSemanticToken","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" depending to size classes."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Kind of composite token with multiple values, but not named “composite” because this word is already used in the design system."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Allows to gather the multiple-value tokens from "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Figma"}]},{"type":"text","text":" inside one object."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If a font token exists with its value depending to the size class, it must be packed in such "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/documentation\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/MultipleFontCompositeSemanticToken","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"final","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MultipleFontCompositeSemanticToken","kind":"identifier"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"code":["        \/\/ Assuming in Figma with have a font semantic token displayLarge,","        \/\/ with values depending to size class. These values are defined as font composite raw tokens.","        let bold850 = FontCompositeSemanticToken(size: size850, lineHeight: lineHeight1050, weight: weight700, letterSpacing: letterSpacing850)","        let bold1450 = FontCompositeSemanticToken(size: size1450, lineHeight: lineHeight1850, weight: weight700, letterSpacing: letterSpacing1450)","","        \/\/ Then the develoment team declares an \"higher\" level font semantic token","        \/\/ inside FontCompositeSemanticTokens protocol,","        \/\/ and defined inside OrangeTheme+FontCompositeSemanticTokens extension","        var displayLarge: MultipleFontCompositeSemanticToken {","            MultipleFontCompositeSemanticToken(compact: bold850, regular: bold1450)","        }","","        \/\/ If the same font is used whatever the size class is","        var displayLarge: MultipleFontCompositeSemanticToken { MultipleFontCompositeSemanticToken(bold650) }","","        \/\/ The theme exposes both generated elevation semantic tokens and \"crafted\" higher level elevation semantic tokens.","        \/\/ It is recommended to use the higher level version as it is less error-prone."],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The case of this "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/documentation\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/MultipleFontCompositeSemanticToken"},{"type":"text","text":" is quite particular because in fact it contains "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FontCompositeSemanticToken"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(i.e. raw tokens) instead of semantic tokens."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"In fact there is not “font composite semantic tokens” defined in the "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Figma","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" kit."}]},{"name":"Since","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"0.22.0","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/documentation\/OUDSTokensSemantic"]]},"topicSections":[{"title":"Operators","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/documentation\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/MultipleFontCompositeSemanticToken\/_(_:_:)"],"anchor":"Operators","generated":true},{"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/documentation\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/MultipleFontCompositeSemanticToken\/init(_:)","doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/documentation\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/MultipleFontCompositeSemanticToken\/init(compact:regular:)"],"anchor":"Initializers","generated":true},{"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/documentation\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/MultipleFontCompositeSemanticToken\/compact","doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/documentation\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/MultipleFontCompositeSemanticToken\/regular"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true},{"title":"Instance Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/documentation\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/MultipleFontCompositeS